{"path":"experimental/simd/simd","title":"std::experimental::simd","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::</span>simd","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/simd/simd","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"The class template simd is a data-parallel type. The width of a given simd instantiation is a constant expression, determined by the template parameters.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/experimental/simd\">&lt;experimental/simd&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-parallelism_ts_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Abi <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> simd_abi<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">compatible</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">class</span> simd<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-parallelism-ts-2 t-mark-ts\">(parallelism TS v2)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>The class template <code>simd</code> is a data-parallel type. The width of a given <code>simd</code> instantiation is a constant expression, determined by the template parameters.\n</p><p>An ABI tag is a type in the <code>simd_abi</code> namespace that indicates a choice of size and binary representation for objects of data-parallel type.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Template_parameters\">Template parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> T\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> element type; an arithmetic type other than <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bo